WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.200
SmartVest Investing Academy.

2
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:07.750
Lesson 11: Risk, Return & Diversification.

3
00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:17.175
There is a fundamental rule in the financial world that every investor must understand: Risk and Potential Return are inextricably linked.

4
00:00:17.175 --> 00:00:25.675
If an investment promises high potential returns, it inevitably comes with higher risk of capital loss or volatility.

5
00:00:25.675 --> 00:00:34.350
Conversely, low-risk options like government treasury bills offer safety, but their returns may barely keep up with inflation.

6
00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:37.975
No investment is completely risk-free.

7
00:00:37.975 --> 00:00:42.062
Even cash carries the silent risk of inflation.

8
00:00:42.062 --> 00:00:50.163
This is why experienced investors rely on the most powerful risk-management tool available: Diversification.

9
00:00:50.163 --> 00:00:55.125
Diversification means not putting all your eggs in one basket.

10
00:00:55.125 --> 00:01:11.537
By spreading your money across different asset classes (like equities, debt, and gold), different industries (like technology, healthcare, and banking), and different geographies (like India and the US), you protect your portfolio.

11
00:01:11.537 --> 00:01:17.637
If one sector suffers a downturn, gains in another asset class can cushion the blow.

12
00:01:17.638 --> 00:01:27.213
Diversification does not eliminate market risk, but it helps ensure that a single bad event does not derail your financial future.

13
00:01:27.213 --> 00:01:30.263
SmartVest Investing Academy.

14
00:01:30.263 --> 00:01:32.088
Learn first.

15
00:01:32.088 --> 00:01:34.538
Invest with understanding.
